WEBVTT

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:09.960
"'The long hair hanging over my face...

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:23.580
Just by your being there,

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:30.250
the world seems to sparkle.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:33.920
At one point,

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:40.260
l had given up on love.

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:46.930
Just for you, God must have...

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:53.270
...done a custom-made job.

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:56.940
This body of mine...

00:00:56.940 --> 00:01:03.880
...is ascending to Heaven
along with carbonated bubbles.

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:04.880
Wait!

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:11.560
Baby, baby, my low tension baby,

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:15.230
Come chasing after me...

00:01:15.230 --> 00:01:18.230
more and more!

00:01:18.230 --> 00:01:24.570
ln heavy, heavy rotation, baby,

00:01:24.570 --> 00:01:28.570
l'm totally...

00:01:28.570 --> 00:01:33.270
...crazy about you!

00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:42.920
What time are you
supposed to meet Okayasu?

00:01:42.920 --> 00:01:45.920
At noon. I told him
that I'd wait five minutes,

00:01:45.920 --> 00:01:47.930
and if he didn't come,
I'd give up on him, but...

00:01:47.930 --> 00:01:51.930
Don't worry. I know you'll
find happiness, Adachi.

00:01:51.930 --> 00:01:53.600
Thank you.

00:01:53.600 --> 00:01:55.860
Well, see you when school starts.

00:02:00.470 --> 00:02:01.870
"'I can't wait to see you."'

00:02:01.870 --> 00:02:03.640
Just a little longer...

00:02:06.880 --> 00:02:09.810
Just a little longer until l see Okayasu!

00:02:10.880 --> 00:02:16.350
"'One Stormy Night"'

00:02:16.350 --> 00:02:24.320
"'Be sure to sit away from the TV
in a well-lit room when watching anime"'

00:02:24.320 --> 00:02:26.060
I'm early.

00:02:26.060 --> 00:02:28.190
I guess I'll go mark time somewhere.

00:02:30.700 --> 00:02:32.030
Welcome!

00:02:32.030 --> 00:02:33.370
Excuse me...

00:02:33.370 --> 00:02:35.040
Do you have any peach blossoms?

00:02:35.040 --> 00:02:38.710
No, I'm sorry.
The season for them is over.

00:02:38.710 --> 00:02:40.040
I see.

00:02:40.040 --> 00:02:41.700
Kairi?

00:02:44.040 --> 00:02:45.050
Misao-chan!

00:02:45.050 --> 00:02:47.710
What a surprise! What on earth
are you doing here?

00:02:47.710 --> 00:02:51.290
Oh, I'm about to meet Momo-chan,

00:02:51.290 --> 00:02:53.720
but I was thinking I didn't
buy her a souvenir or anything...

00:02:53.720 --> 00:02:58.060
You don't say. I hear you were
away from home? Were did you go?

00:02:58.060 --> 00:02:59.390
I was working at a soba noodle shop.

00:02:59.390 --> 00:03:00.390
A soba noodle shop?!

00:03:00.390 --> 00:03:04.670
Well, it's a long story, but at least I
found the answer that I was looking for.

00:03:04.670 --> 00:03:06.000
The answer?

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:10.340
Yeah. I realized that the
one I love best is Momo-chan.

00:03:10.340 --> 00:03:14.680
Misao-chan, I think now that
you were close to my ideal...

00:03:14.680 --> 00:03:19.010
For instance, if you had to say who in
all the world you most wanted to be with,

00:03:19.010 --> 00:03:21.680
what would you say, Misao-chan?

00:03:21.680 --> 00:03:23.680
I'd want to be with Momo-chan.

00:03:23.680 --> 00:03:25.820
I realized she's the one who,
when all is said and done,

00:03:25.820 --> 00:03:28.020
I can relax with.

00:03:28.020 --> 00:03:29.020
Kairi...

00:03:29.020 --> 00:03:30.360
You've changed, it seems.

00:03:30.360 --> 00:03:32.030
Huh? How?

00:03:32.030 --> 00:03:36.360
You're a lot more collected.
It makes you much more manly.

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:40.700
It does?! Whoopeee! I did it!

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:44.710
Well, now it's my turn. It's time
to bring things to a conclusion.

00:03:44.710 --> 00:03:48.510
Conclusion? Are you going
to tell Ryo how you feel?

00:03:49.380 --> 00:03:53.050
Actually, I'm on my way to see him now.

00:03:53.050 --> 00:03:55.480
I know he's dating Kashiwagi-san now,
and that there isn't really any hope,

00:03:55.480 --> 00:03:57.320
but I thought that even
if I suffer an admirable defeat,

00:03:57.320 --> 00:04:00.390
things could turn out
better than I'd hoped.

00:04:00.390 --> 00:04:01.990
I see...

00:04:01.990 --> 00:04:04.660
But I might not be able to say it
when I finally face him,

00:04:04.660 --> 00:04:08.330
so I thought I'd tell him
with the language of flowers.

00:04:08.330 --> 00:04:14.330
Oh, I know what peach blossoms mean!
They say, "'I'm your slave!"'

00:04:14.330 --> 00:04:16.670
You looked it up because
it's Adachi-san's name, right?

00:04:16.670 --> 00:04:21.680
Yeah, but they're not selling them now.
Misao-chan, what are you going to buy?

00:04:21.680 --> 00:04:23.340
Red roses.

00:04:24.340 --> 00:04:28.020
They have the meaning of
"'passion"' and "'true love."'

00:04:28.020 --> 00:04:31.510
Oh, yeah? Well, that's what I'll get, too.

00:04:36.360 --> 00:04:38.030
Where are you supposed to meet Ryo?

00:04:38.030 --> 00:04:39.690
Somewhere around here.

00:04:39.690 --> 00:04:44.360
Well, privately, I'm praying things
don't go well with you and Ryo...

00:04:44.360 --> 00:04:47.700
Not because I'm jealous or anything!

00:04:47.700 --> 00:04:50.240
And I hate to throw cold water
on your dreams

00:04:50.240 --> 00:04:52.710
now that you've set them
in motion, Misao-chan...

00:04:52.710 --> 00:04:54.370
But come on! Ryo is...

00:04:54.370 --> 00:04:56.380
What about me?

00:04:56.380 --> 00:04:58.710
Ack!

00:04:58.710 --> 00:05:01.320
Ack? What's with this, "'ack"'?

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:03.320
Now, when some idiot finds himself
in the hospital with pneumonia,

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:04.620
and without his health insurance card,

00:05:04.620 --> 00:05:07.320
who was it who came
running down there with it?

00:05:07.320 --> 00:05:10.990
So? How are you feeling now?

00:05:10.990 --> 00:05:11.660
Well....

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:13.990
That's good.

00:05:13.990 --> 00:05:17.000
And by the way, isn't there something
which you've forgotten to say to me?

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:18.430
W- what?

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:23.000
"'I know how busy you are,
and I want to thank you

00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:24.340
for visiting me in the hospital,
my sweet brother!"'

00:05:24.340 --> 00:05:26.340
You sarcastic son of a...

00:05:26.340 --> 00:05:28.010
What're you calling me?!

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:30.340
Then pay me back what I loaned you
for the hospital fees!

00:05:30.340 --> 00:05:34.010
You pig! Trying to extort money
from your sick younger brother!

00:05:34.010 --> 00:05:36.680
Okayasu Ryo!

00:05:36.680 --> 00:05:41.360
You filthy bastard! Because of you,
my business went bankrupt!

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:45.760
What are you talking about?
Business always means competition.

00:05:53.030 --> 00:05:54.400
Ryo-kun!

00:06:17.660 --> 00:06:19.290
Okayasu!

00:06:27.330 --> 00:06:29.340
What was with that man?

00:06:29.340 --> 00:06:34.340
Why did he attack Ryo-kun?
What does he think Ryo-kun's done to him?

00:06:34.340 --> 00:06:36.210
Calm down, Misao-chan...

00:06:38.350 --> 00:06:39.350
Yes?

00:06:39.350 --> 00:06:41.350
Hello? Okayasu?

00:06:41.350 --> 00:06:44.020
Momo-chan! Ah! I'm sorry!

00:06:44.020 --> 00:06:45.090
Something important came up,

00:06:45.090 --> 00:06:46.820
and I'm going to be
a little late getting there...

00:06:46.820 --> 00:06:49.020
What shall I do?

00:06:49.020 --> 00:06:53.360
I'll call you in a bit, so can you
just hang out there a while?

00:06:53.360 --> 00:06:54.360
But...

00:06:54.360 --> 00:06:55.690
Huh?

00:06:58.700 --> 00:07:02.300
But it has to be now...

00:07:02.300 --> 00:07:08.400
Hello? Momo-chan? I'll be there as soon
as I possibly can, okay? See you later.

00:07:22.660 --> 00:07:24.660
Are you okay, Misao-chan?

00:07:24.660 --> 00:07:30.330
Yes, I'm much calmer now.
I'm sorry I lost it earlier.

00:07:30.330 --> 00:07:33.670
Well, no wonder!
After witnessing such a thing!

00:07:33.670 --> 00:07:36.340
Well, I'm glad that Ryo-kun
wasn't seriously hurt.

00:07:36.340 --> 00:07:38.340
That's thanks to you, Misao-chan!

00:07:38.340 --> 00:07:42.010
It was because you threw yourself in
front of Ryo that the other guy held back.

00:07:42.010 --> 00:07:45.010
I'm telling you, that Ryo is one lucky guy.

00:07:45.010 --> 00:07:47.010
Hadn't you better be getting back, Kairi?

00:07:47.010 --> 00:07:50.350
Why? I'll stay here with you. I want
to hear what the doctors say anyway...

00:07:50.350 --> 00:07:54.350
What are you talking about? You have an
appointment with Adachi-san, don't you?

00:07:54.350 --> 00:07:58.360
I can't leave you when you're upset,
Misao-chan! It's all right.

00:07:58.360 --> 00:08:01.630
Besides, Momo-chan and I have
all the time in the world to be together.

00:08:01.630 --> 00:08:04.260
Maybe that's not how Adachi-san sees it.

00:08:06.970 --> 00:08:08.640
Huh?

00:08:08.640 --> 00:08:10.540
All this time in my heart,

00:08:10.540 --> 00:08:13.640
I've been thinking about
always being together with Momo-chan,

00:08:13.640 --> 00:08:17.310
but now that I think about it,
I haven't told her yet!

00:08:17.310 --> 00:08:19.980
Oh, no! Momo-chan may be anxious!

00:08:19.980 --> 00:08:22.540
Call her! Right now!

00:08:24.650 --> 00:08:27.990
The person you are calling
is not available...

00:08:27.990 --> 00:08:30.660
No! I can't reach her! Why not?!

00:08:30.660 --> 00:08:35.000
Okayasu, if you get things worked out
in your head and decide you still want me,

00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:37.330
then meet me in the plaza in front
of the station at 12:00 on that day.

00:08:37.330 --> 00:08:39.570
I'll wait five minutes,

00:08:39.570 --> 00:08:42.690
and if you don't come,
I'll know to forget you, Okayasu.

00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:48.140
I'll be back!

00:08:54.350 --> 00:08:58.020
Why was Okayasu with Misao-chan?

00:08:58.020 --> 00:09:02.620
Did they just happen to
run into each other? Or was it...

00:09:02.620 --> 00:09:07.630
l'll be there as soon as
l possibly can, okay? See you later.

00:09:07.630 --> 00:09:10.120
l really do come second with him...

00:09:11.630 --> 00:09:15.400
That's how Okayasu really feels...

00:09:18.970 --> 00:09:20.460
What are you doing?

00:09:26.310 --> 00:09:27.940
Where's Okayasu?

00:09:34.650 --> 00:09:37.320
He said something came up...

00:09:37.320 --> 00:09:40.330
...and I should hang out here
until he contacts me.

00:09:40.330 --> 00:09:42.660
Oh, is that all? Okay, in that case...

00:09:42.660 --> 00:09:44.330
But...

00:09:44.330 --> 00:09:49.340
I saw him with Misao-chan,
going someplace in a car.

00:09:49.340 --> 00:09:52.010
There must be a good reason.

00:09:52.010 --> 00:09:53.670
Maybe...

00:09:53.670 --> 00:09:56.270
But, I...

00:10:00.010 --> 00:10:01.570
...can't wait any longer.

00:10:03.350 --> 00:10:05.410
Let me out here!

00:10:08.690 --> 00:10:13.520
Momo-chan!

00:10:15.360 --> 00:10:18.200
Momo-chan! Momo-chan!

00:10:22.700 --> 00:10:26.040
Okayasu, l really tried my hardest...

00:10:26.040 --> 00:10:30.040
l wanted all this time to be the
most important person to you, Okayasu...

00:10:30.040 --> 00:10:34.380
But sometimes, even when you
try your hardest, it doesn't work out...

00:10:34.380 --> 00:10:37.050
l don't want the happiness
of being Number Two any more.

00:10:37.050 --> 00:10:41.720
Okayasu, lf l can't have you
to myself, l don't want you.

00:10:41.720 --> 00:10:46.060
Ah, hello? This is Okayasu!
Is Momo-chan over there?

00:10:46.060 --> 00:10:49.400
Adachi? No, she's not here.

00:10:49.400 --> 00:10:54.400
Adachi was going on a trip.
Weren't you supposed to go with her?

00:10:54.400 --> 00:10:58.740
You were late meeting her?
She probably got mad and went home.

00:10:58.740 --> 00:11:02.340
That's what I thought, but when I
called there, they said she wasn't in.

00:11:02.340 --> 00:11:05.950
Anyway, if you hear from Momo-chan,
give me a call, okay?

00:11:05.950 --> 00:11:06.780
Let's see...

00:11:06.780 --> 00:11:07.410
Where else could Momo-chan be?

00:11:07.410 --> 00:11:09.540
"'Sae-chan
Suzuki Makoto
Takahashi Yoko"'

00:11:13.350 --> 00:11:15.840
Un-uh! No way!

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:20.030
Due to the approaching typhoon,
please do not go out in the water.

00:11:20.030 --> 00:11:21.760
The waves are high and very dangerous.

00:11:28.700 --> 00:11:31.170
That day was a day like this, too...

00:11:41.050 --> 00:11:44.350
l wanted to see the ocean
with you once again...

00:11:46.720 --> 00:11:52.090
Okayasu... Okayasu... Okayasu...
l waited for you!

00:11:52.090 --> 00:11:55.530
"'I can't wait to see you."'

00:11:57.400 --> 00:12:00.670
Good-bye Okayasu...

00:12:00.670 --> 00:12:03.000
l truly did adore you.

00:12:07.340 --> 00:12:10.010
What a cute hairstyle!

00:12:10.010 --> 00:12:16.350
What? You're crying? Well, cheer up!
I know lots of fun places we can go!

00:12:16.350 --> 00:12:17.350
Come on!

00:12:17.350 --> 00:12:19.020
S- stop it!

00:12:19.020 --> 00:12:20.990
You got something to say to my girl?

00:12:23.690 --> 00:12:25.030
Toji?

00:12:25.030 --> 00:12:28.150
Uh... no! Never mind.

00:12:29.030 --> 00:12:30.700
Why?

00:12:30.700 --> 00:12:33.370
I'm sorry for following you here.

00:12:33.370 --> 00:12:35.490
I was a little concerned
by your attitude when I left you...

00:12:36.700 --> 00:12:40.040
I wanted to be by myself
and get my feelings worked out.

00:12:40.040 --> 00:12:41.040
I see.

00:12:41.040 --> 00:12:45.050
I'm okay. I'm going to stay here a
little while longer and then go on back.

00:12:45.050 --> 00:12:49.720
Thank you for worrying about me.
You can go on back first.

00:12:49.720 --> 00:12:53.390
No, I'll go back with you. I can wait.

00:12:53.390 --> 00:12:56.390
But I don't know how long
it's going to take...

00:12:56.390 --> 00:12:59.380
No big deal. I'm a patient guy.

00:13:28.350 --> 00:13:31.360
You idiot! Momo-chan told you!

00:13:31.360 --> 00:13:35.030
She was going to wait for five minutes,
and if you didn't come, she'd forget you!

00:13:35.030 --> 00:13:37.700
How could you break such
an important promise?!

00:13:37.700 --> 00:13:41.370
Do you think Momo-chan really
went to the seashore by herself?

00:13:41.370 --> 00:13:43.040
What else is there?

00:13:43.040 --> 00:13:44.940
Boy, this boxed lunch
from the station is delicious!

00:13:44.940 --> 00:13:47.370
Okayasu, you shoulda bought one!

00:13:47.370 --> 00:13:51.040
You know, Sae-chan, you didn't
really have to come with me.

00:13:51.040 --> 00:13:54.710
I'm worried about Momo-chan, too!

00:13:54.710 --> 00:13:59.720
Poor thing! Momo-chan was looking
forward to this trip so eagerly!

00:13:59.720 --> 00:14:03.320
Why did I ever call her? I'm a moron!

00:14:03.320 --> 00:14:09.330
Seriously now, Momo-chan was really,
passionately looking forward to this trip.

00:14:09.330 --> 00:14:14.330
During that five minutes she was
waiting for you, her whole life changed.

00:14:14.330 --> 00:14:16.670
If you had been there on time,

00:14:16.670 --> 00:14:19.670
she was ready to forgive you
your old girlfriends, anything,

00:14:19.670 --> 00:14:27.080
and take you as you are! That's how
important that promise was to Momo-chan.

00:14:28.010 --> 00:14:33.350
And then you go and blow it off!
What were you doing?!

00:14:33.350 --> 00:14:36.690
Ryo was hurt and in the hospital...

00:14:36.690 --> 00:14:39.360
What?! Why didn't you
tell me this earlier?!

00:14:39.360 --> 00:14:43.030
What am I gonna do?! I have to go
to Ryo-sama's side! I'm getting off!

00:14:43.030 --> 00:14:44.700
Stop this train! Lemme off this train!

00:14:44.700 --> 00:14:46.930
Impossible! This is an express...

00:14:50.370 --> 00:14:52.370
--It stopped!
--It stopped!

00:14:52.370 --> 00:14:54.170
Ladies and Gentlemen,

00:14:54.170 --> 00:14:56.710
due to the approaching typhoon and
the danger of landslides on the tracks,

00:14:56.710 --> 00:15:00.650
operations of all Tokyo-bound trains
have been postponed.

00:15:00.650 --> 00:15:03.750
E- excuse me! I'm trying to get home.

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:05.320
The trains will be moving
by tonight, won't they?

00:15:05.320 --> 00:15:07.320
No, that's very unlikely.

00:15:07.320 --> 00:15:10.660
No way! We're not getting
outta here till the typhoon passes.

00:15:10.660 --> 00:15:12.330
Let's find a hotel, quick.

00:15:12.330 --> 00:15:15.330
I'm sorry. If I hadn't taken so long...

00:15:15.330 --> 00:15:18.000
No, it was my decision to come after you.

00:15:18.000 --> 00:15:22.340
But Adachi, you've got reservations at
an inn, don't you? You stay there tonight.

00:15:22.340 --> 00:15:24.000
But Toji, what about you?

00:15:24.000 --> 00:15:26.010
Oh, I'll just sleep on a bench here tonight.

00:15:26.010 --> 00:15:30.340
I'm sorry, sir, but this
station closes up at night.

00:15:30.340 --> 00:15:35.010
I'm very sorry, but tonight
everything is booked solid.

00:15:35.010 --> 00:15:36.480
"'Hotel Information Desk"'

00:15:39.350 --> 00:15:41.350
Now what should we do?

00:15:41.350 --> 00:15:43.690
Okay! I'm going to the hospital!

00:15:43.690 --> 00:15:44.620
Right!

00:15:49.360 --> 00:15:51.090
"'Taxi Stand"'

00:15:52.030 --> 00:15:53.700
Oh, my! You're soaked to the skin!

00:15:53.700 --> 00:15:55.790
Please, come in!

00:15:57.040 --> 00:15:59.210
I'll prepare dinner right away.

00:15:59.210 --> 00:16:00.610
Meanwhile, please feel
free to use the baths.

00:16:00.610 --> 00:16:02.800
"'Ueda Inn"'

00:16:08.310 --> 00:16:12.270
What am l gonna do?
l never saw this happening...

00:16:14.650 --> 00:16:16.990
T- that was a wonderful bath, huh?

00:16:16.990 --> 00:16:20.820
Mm-hmm... S- shall we
go back to our room?

00:16:22.660 --> 00:16:25.000
I've spread out your bedding.

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:27.660
Please leave your dishes
out in the hallway.

00:16:34.340 --> 00:16:36.340
T- this is so uncomfortable!

00:16:36.340 --> 00:16:38.680
L- let's turn the TV on!

00:16:38.680 --> 00:16:40.350
Y- yeah...

00:16:40.350 --> 00:16:42.350
Let's see... 100 yen, 100 yen...

00:16:42.350 --> 00:16:44.110
I have it.

00:16:54.690 --> 00:16:58.560
It surprised me...
That was quite a thunderclap!

00:17:04.970 --> 00:17:05.970
Adachi...

00:17:05.970 --> 00:17:08.980
Couldn't I be your love?

00:17:08.980 --> 00:17:09.980
Toji...

00:17:09.980 --> 00:17:11.710
"'Taxi Stand"'
Due to the increasing
strength of the typhoon,

00:17:11.710 --> 00:17:13.910
"'Taxi Stand"'
operation of all trains
is being suspended...

00:17:13.910 --> 00:17:17.950
It's impossible, young man,
trying to get to Shiranami tonight.

00:17:17.950 --> 00:17:19.320
I won't tell you wrong.

00:17:19.320 --> 00:17:22.660
The best thing is for you to wait until
morning when the trains will run again.

00:17:22.660 --> 00:17:25.020
I don't care! Take me
as far as this will get me!

00:17:32.670 --> 00:17:36.670
T- Toji? Shouldn't you answer that?

00:17:36.670 --> 00:17:37.340
It's okay.

00:17:37.340 --> 00:17:41.010
But it might be something important.

00:17:41.010 --> 00:17:44.770
There's nothing more important than
being here like this with you, Adachi.

00:17:48.350 --> 00:17:53.350
Sometimes, even now, I dream about
the night of your birthday party, Adachi...

00:17:53.350 --> 00:17:55.690
Each time I dream it,
I am filled with regret...

00:17:55.690 --> 00:18:00.030
If only you hadn't answered the phone
that night, if only I'd gone with you...

00:18:00.030 --> 00:18:03.630
Adachi, you'd be by my side now...

00:18:03.630 --> 00:18:05.320
I don't want to let you go again.

00:18:10.640 --> 00:18:12.640
You're wearing the
same earrings as that night.

00:18:12.640 --> 00:18:17.640
Hm? Oh, yeah... It's amazing
that you'd remember that.

00:18:17.640 --> 00:18:20.980
Adachi, I remember everything about you.

00:18:20.980 --> 00:18:22.380
Toji...

00:18:26.650 --> 00:18:31.320
What on earth is it that makes you want
to go to Shiranami, no matter what?

00:18:31.320 --> 00:18:36.000
Someone is waiting for me.
Waiting a long, long time.

00:18:36.000 --> 00:18:40.000
In that case, what harm
would another day or two be?

00:18:40.000 --> 00:18:41.670
If that person has waited
this long already?

00:18:41.670 --> 00:18:44.000
That's what I thought, too...

00:18:44.000 --> 00:18:48.510
But I had just jumped to the conclusion
that she would wait, unchanging,

00:18:48.510 --> 00:18:50.340
forever for me.

00:18:50.340 --> 00:18:52.310
I was naive.

00:18:55.680 --> 00:18:58.840
What the?! Oh, geez!

00:19:00.020 --> 00:19:01.290
Is there another road?

00:19:01.290 --> 00:19:06.290
No. There's only one road through
the mountains to Shiranami.

00:19:06.290 --> 00:19:10.630
Sorry, but we're outta luck.
Time to go back.

00:19:10.630 --> 00:19:14.970
Driver, how far is it
from here to Shiranami?

00:19:14.970 --> 00:19:16.970
At least 20 km.

00:19:16.970 --> 00:19:20.640
Thank you! Here, this is for the fare.

00:19:20.640 --> 00:19:25.770
Y- you can't walk
all that way! Sir! Sir!

00:19:40.990 --> 00:19:44.330
I wonder if Momo-chan is all right...

00:19:44.330 --> 00:19:45.590
You don't suppose...

00:19:49.000 --> 00:19:50.340
Ah! There it is!

00:19:50.340 --> 00:19:52.390
"'Ueda Inn TEL: 0XX...."'

00:19:55.680 --> 00:19:57.680
Hello, this is the Ueda Inn...

00:19:57.680 --> 00:20:00.680
Excuse me! Is there a girl named
Adachi Momo-san staying there?

00:20:00.680 --> 00:20:06.020
Yes, she's here. She's here with a friend.

00:20:06.020 --> 00:20:07.350
A friend?

00:20:07.350 --> 00:20:11.020
Is there a message for her?
Could I have your name, please?

00:20:11.020 --> 00:20:13.790
Hello? Hello?

00:20:23.370 --> 00:20:24.370
Thank you for everything.

00:20:24.370 --> 00:20:26.370
Take care now!

00:20:26.370 --> 00:20:28.370
What a gorgeous day!

00:20:28.370 --> 00:20:30.380
Makes yesterday's typhoon
seem unreal, huh?

00:20:30.380 --> 00:20:31.570
Mm-hmm.

00:20:38.380 --> 00:20:41.010
With Toji, l can find happiness...

00:20:43.390 --> 00:20:48.020
He's always, always taken care of me...

00:20:50.730 --> 00:20:54.070
A train is now arriving on Track #2.

00:20:54.070 --> 00:20:57.130
Please stand behind the white line.

00:21:03.340 --> 00:21:04.710
But...

00:21:08.350 --> 00:21:11.350
ls this really the right thing?

00:21:11.350 --> 00:21:17.020
The me that loved Okayasu
is telling me not to move on...

00:21:17.020 --> 00:21:20.360
l never really told him
that we were breaking up...

00:21:20.360 --> 00:21:23.520
Don't tell me l'm still holding out
some hope for Okayasu...

00:21:26.370 --> 00:21:29.040
Boy, I wish I didn't have to work tonight.

00:21:29.040 --> 00:21:30.700
You've got the late shift tonight.

00:21:30.700 --> 00:21:31.370
Yeah.

00:21:31.370 --> 00:21:32.710
Hang in there.

00:21:32.710 --> 00:21:35.270
Okay. See you at school tomorrow.

00:21:40.710 --> 00:21:42.340
Adachi!

00:21:47.720 --> 00:21:50.390
Say, Toji, how about we come
up with our own little sign?

00:21:50.390 --> 00:21:54.550
What if we make an ''L'' with our fingers
that means ''love''? See? See?

00:21:56.730 --> 00:21:59.070
Toji...

00:21:59.070 --> 00:22:00.460
Toji!

00:22:11.680 --> 00:22:13.580
Momo-chan...

00:22:19.690 --> 00:22:23.450
l want to find happiness...

00:22:24.360 --> 00:22:27.520
lt's all right for me
to be happy, isn't it?

00:22:36.940 --> 00:22:43.280
So much that l can't express it very well...

00:22:43.280 --> 00:22:52.950
so much that l can't believe it...

00:22:52.950 --> 00:22:55.960
l become so uneasy.

00:22:55.960 --> 00:23:02.560
l can't be all alone for so long.

00:23:02.560 --> 00:23:08.900
Where can we go

00:23:08.900 --> 00:23:18.580
where we can all be

00:23:18.580 --> 00:23:21.250
under the same sky?

00:23:21.250 --> 00:23:29.590
l'm sure that there will be stars there.

00:23:29.590 --> 00:23:36.260
No matter how hard things might be,

00:23:36.260 --> 00:23:42.600
there surely, surely is an answer.

00:23:42.600 --> 00:23:49.940
l just wish that l could be

00:23:49.940 --> 00:23:57.710
someone with that kind of courage.

00:24:01.220 --> 00:24:06.230
Look at him! He's acting like
nothing at all happened! What a fool!

00:24:06.230 --> 00:24:11.230
Okayasu never thought of me the way
l thought of him! Well, l've had it!

00:24:11.230 --> 00:24:14.830
Next time on Peach Girl,
"'Continuous Love Storm Warnings"'
